ceman.<br>\nThe powerful man came over to me. \"Nice football,\" he said. I could have fainted.<br>\nI answered in a whisper, \"Would you arrest me for something so small?\"<br>\nThe big man looked puzzled. \"Why should I arrest you?\" he asked.<br>\n\"I stole this football,\" I said.<br>\nThe man smiled. \"I'm not a policeman,\" he said. \"You could return the football if you wanted to.\"<br>\n\"I can't,\" I said. \" I would be in big trouble.\"", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le08ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "61000", "text": "He took two steps forward and punted it. I couldn't believe my eyes.<br>\n\"You could be a football player,\" I said in amazement.<br>\n\"I am a football player,\" the big man said with a smile. \"And I think you might be one someday.<br>\n\"Don't I wish,\" I said.<br>\n\"I think I can take care of that,\" my new protector said. \u201cI used to be just like you\u201d.<br>\nThat's the story of how I was \"discovered\" and how I have had a lot of interesting experiences. Ten years later, I became a star on the same football team. My nickname was \"Stealer.\" No one but the coach knew why!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le08ob08re2img03.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le08ob08re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le08ob08re3vid01"}}], "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}